  "_about": "Every moment the game answers with a sound and a buzz, and every colour a floating number or word takes, in one place (autoload/feedback.gd). `sound` is a name in sounds.json, `buzz` a vibration in ms (phones), `gain_db` makes the sound softer or louder. Code asks by name: Feedback.moment(\"place\"). `rarities` is the one look and sound of every find, by how rare it is (a gopher, a collectible, a bird, a baby, a stray, what a mystery item opens to): its colour, its moment, how many sparks fly and how far, how big they are, the size of its words and how long they stay.",
